  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission reference: 2023/02534/FUL dated 5th February 2024 for the \"Erection of an additional floor together with the formation of a roof terrace at roof level; erection of a single storey rear extension, to the side and rear of the existing back addition at basement level; erection of an external staircase from basement to ground floor level at the rear of the property; infilling of 1no window at the side of rear back additions at ground and first floor level (northern elevation); installation of a new window to replace the existing window to the side of rear back addition, and replacement of existing doors with a new window to the rear of proposed bedroom 5 at basement level; replacement of selected windows with new double glazed windows, and relocation of 2no windows to southern and eastern elevation of the main building at no. 12 Ongar Road; erection of boundary wall and gates to Sedlescombe Road elevation.\" Amendments sought to allow retention of the existing floor levels at first and second floor level, replacement of proposed windows within existing openings, parapet 'moulding' detail at third floor roof level to match the existing detail design.",
